aged incl \u00a351m with local authorities; \u00a336.762m externally managed pooled funds at fair value), up \u00a37.237m from \u00a3111.520m","as_at":"31/3/26","page":2},{"name":"borrowing","value":"nil \u2014 debt-free; CFR \u00a30 and external borrowing \u00a30 across 2025-26 actual and forecasts to 2029-30","as_at":"31/3/26","page":6},{"name":"treasury outturn vs budget","value":"treasury income \u00a36.030m actual vs \u00a34.164m budget (internally managed \u00a34.161m vs \u00a32.389m; pooled funds \u00a31.869m vs \u00a31.775m)","as_at":"2025/26","page":4},{"name":"pooled fund returns","value":"income \u00a31,819k (5.01%) in 2025-26; \u00a312,323k income since 2016 purchase; cumulative capital return -\u00a33,238k (+\u00a3423k in year)","as_at":"31/3/26","page":3},{"name":"commercial portfolio","value":"investment properties valued \u00a313.13m; \u00a3767k rental income less \u00a3127k direct costs = \u00a3640k net surplus; voids 5.4% (2/37 units) vs 2.27% in 2024-25","as_at":"31/3/26","page":12},{"name":"commercial income proportion","value":"4.5% of net revenue stream (\u00a30.77m income on \u00a317.03m NRS; council ceiling 10%)","as_at":"2025/26","page":5}],"commercial":{"commercial_portfolio":{"value":"investment properties valued \u00a313.13m; \u00a3767k rental income less \u00a3127k direct costs = \u00a3640k net surplus; voids 5.4% (2/37 units) vs 2.27% in 2024-25","as_at":"31/3/26","page":12,"doc":"Treasury Management Outturn"}},"tms_components":null},"compliance":null,"documents":[{"title":"Treasury Management Outturn Report 2025-26 - CGAC","url":"https://chichester.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s32809/treasury-management-outturn-report-2025-26-cgac.pdf","committee":"Corporate Governance & Audit Committee","date":"13/07/2026","key":true},{"title":"DRAFT Annual Governance Statement 2025-26","url":"https://chichester.moderngov.co.uk/documents/s32815/draft-annual-governance-statement-2025-26.pdf","committee":"Corporate Governance & Audit Committee","date":"13/